:::requirement{#acme-keeps-each-order kind="behavior"}
ACME keeps each order that a customer sends.
:::

:::requirement{#an-order-survives-a-restart kind="behavior" parent="acme-keeps-each-order"}
ACME keeps each stored order after the order service starts again.
:::

:::requirement{#an-order-survives-a-restart kind="behavior" parent="acme-keeps-each-order"}
ACME keeps each stored order and its state after the order service starts again.
:::

:::requirement{#orders-reach-billing-only-through-the-interface kind="structure" parent="acme-keeps-each-order" about="orders-to-billing"}
The order service sends each order to billing only through the interface between them.
:::

:::component{#billing name="Billing"}
It sends a bill for each order.
:::

:::component{#orders name="Orders"}
It keeps the orders that customers send.
:::

:::component{#orders-to-billing name="Orders to billing" kind="interface" joins="billing orders"}
Orders sends each order to billing through it.
:::

:::component{#shipping name="Shipping"}
It sends the products of each paid order.
:::

:::term{#order name="order"}
An order is a request of a customer for one or more products.
:::

:::requirement{#an-order-is-paid-once kind="behavior" parent="acme-keeps-each-order"}
ACME takes the payment of each order one time.
:::

:::requirement{#an-order-is-paid-once kind="behavior" parent="acme-keeps-each-order"}
ACME takes the payment of each order one time and refunds each second payment.
:::
